infinite-patch 1
# Synthwave Analog Poly Brass Lead Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.25
  i steps 16
  i note0 60
  i note1 60
  i note2 72
  i note3 67
  i note4 60
  i note5 72
